SUMMARY:Brad Williams "The Tall Tales" 
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nJoin us for an evening of laughter a
 nd great company! Brad Williams will be performing at the Carolina Theater
  in Durham. Doors open at 6pm and the show starts at 7pm.\n\n"Brad William
 s is a global comedy headliner known for explosive performances and fearle
 ss storytelling. His specials include Live On Short Street\, viral hit Sta
 rfish with 9 million views\, Fun Size\, and Daddy Issues. He’s appeared 
 on The Tonight Show\, Jimmy Kimmel Live\, The Joe Rogan Experience\, and N
 etflix’s The Degenerates. The first stand-up comedian to headline a Cirq
 ue du Soleil production\, Brad continues to sell out theaters worldwide\, 
 proving one of comedy’s biggest stars comes in a small package." (https:
 //bradwilliamscomedy.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31648
 3775/
